{
  "uid": "raiji-gargalos",
  "title": "Raiji · Gargalos (CPU × Memória × Latência)",
  "tags": [
    "raiji",
    "observabilidade"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chat · latência das sondas (s)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(raiji_probe_duration_seconds{service=\"chat\"} and on(service,url) (raiji_probe_up{service=\"chat\"} == 1))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "latência"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chat · CPU por container (%)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "raiji_container_cpu_percent{container=~\"raiji-(scale-)?chat.*\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chat · memória por container (MB)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "raiji_container_memory_bytes{container=~\"raiji-(scale-)?chat.*\"} / 1024 / 1024",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decmbytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Serviços fora do ar",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "raiji_probe_up",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fila × consumidores",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "raiji_rabbit_queue_messages{queue=~\"chat.*\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "mensagens {{queue}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "raiji_rabbit_queue_consumers{queue=~\"chat.*\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "consumers {{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Identificação do gargalo",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Árvore de decisão\n| Sintoma | Gargalo |\n|---|---|\n| CPU por réplica ~100% e p95 sobe | Aplicação (CPU) |\n| CPU baixa, p95 alto, fila cresce | Consumidor/DB (escrita) |\n| Host ~100%, p95 piora ao escalar | Contenção de host (limite vertical) |\n| RPS satura com N>1 e CPU por réplica cai | Recurso compartilhado (DB/Kong/Rabbit) |\n| Memória crescendo no tempo | Leak/GC |\n\n**Fórmula:** eficiência `E = (RPS_N / N) / RPS_1`.\n`E ≈ 1` escala linear; `E < 0,8` indique gargalo compartilhado.\n"
      },
      "transparent": false
    }
  ]
}